{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56869","headline":"果州百姓爲史谦恕歌（题从《古谣谚》卷五三） · 佚名","name":"果州百姓爲史谦恕歌（题从《古谣谚》卷五三）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"使君来何晚，昔日无储今有饭。\n（《海录碎事》卷十二）（〖1〗《海录碎事》：史谦恕爲果州刺史，百姓歌之曰〖歌略〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}